   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Back to Basum**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Stella Blue**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **North Pappy Flappy**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2000-05-18** (recommended): source not stated; 38 songs; 191 min [1]. Said about its sound: Some minor clicks were removed with Gold Wave, including one in disc 2 track 8; the uploader never retracked it properly [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2000-05-18**: taped by anonymous; source: FOB AKG 461's > Lunatec V2 > SBM-1 > D8 [1]. Also: Taped with FOB AKG 461 microphones through a Lunatec V2 and SBM-1 to DAT, then an HHB850 deck; Transfer chain went through EAC and Gold Wave to SHN; jweiss seeded it to an etree FTP in May 2000, reseeded as FLAC in April 2005 [1]",
